# Committed inside the $HERMES_DATA/skills/ git repo (design.md §11, spec §9).
# Defence in depth against a skill dropping a cache DB in its own folder and
# quietly turning a text repo into a binary one. `state.db` itself lives at
# $HERMES_DATA/state.db, outside this repo's root (excluded by scope, D7).
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.log
*.tmp
.cache/
.DS_Store
